# ---- OS ----
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# ---- Working notes, kept on the maintainer's machine ----
# The engineering journals and the working notes beside them: French, dated, raw. They are the
# project's memory, so they are not deleted -- but a public repository's history is not the place
# for them, so they live in one ignored directory and stay off the published tree. Anything of that
# kind belongs there rather than at the root, which is why this is a single rule: a working note
# that appears anywhere else is visible, and that is the point. docs/history/README.md says what
# each file is.
docs/history/

# ---- Recorded benchmark runs (bench/compare.sh --record) ----
bench/.runs/
bench/.ab/

# ---- The map of the methods each test class runs (tools/testimpact map), rebuilt locally ----
tests/.impact/
AUDIT-SRC-2026-09-25.md

# ---- Vorticity.Zstd: what its native tools build and the data its tests and benchmarks read ----
# libzstd 1.5.7 and the harness (tools/native-ref/build.sh), the hardware counters library
# (tools/pmu/build.sh); the test data, zstd's golden files and a decodecorpus corpus
# (tools/native-ref/testdata.sh), and zstd's benchmark data (bench/zstd-corpus.sh): binary files,
# written rather than kept.
tools/native-ref/out/
tools/pmu/out/
tests/Vorticity.Zstd.Tests/testdata/
